comments:
bf224592:  .;
 .;Display help screen for user commands.
 .;Uses DISP^XQORM1 to display options.
 .;

6b01bf27:  .;
 .;Process help request for '?' input.
 .;Calls HLPS for detailed help, then pauses with PAUSE^VALM1.
 .;Clears the screen to display help information cleanly.
 .;

fabef7a9:  .;
 .;Entry point for text-based help.
 .;This label is intended as a starting point for displaying text help sections.
 .;

f80f30a6:  .;
 .;Label for deletion of help text.
 .;This could be a placeholder for functionality to remove outdated or unnecessary help text.
 .;

e3fff19d:  .;
 .;Determines the status of a given entry.
 .;Extracts and checks data from the VAS file to determine the current status.
 .;DGJX contains the zero node of the entry, DGJY extracts the status, and DGJTPD gets the type from the associated file.
 .;
